    "title": "Leadville-based attorney jumps into race for outgoing Colorado Rep. Julie McCluskie's seat - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Robert Tann ,\n8 hours ago Chris Floyd, a Leadville-based attorney and member of the Democratic Party, is running to represent House District 13 in the state House next November. The seat is currently held by House Speaker Julie McCluskie, a Dillon Democrat who has served in the legislature since 2019. McCluskie is term-limited and cannot seek reelection in 2026. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
